---
description: Express a confirmed concession as one testable behavior with scope and failure condition.
args:{compromise:CompromiseOption;evidence:EvidencePage[]}
returns:RequirementClause[]
---
State observable input conditions, required behavior, failure behavior, release phase and the source position authorizing the clause. Remove implementation preference unless the authorized agreement explicitly fixes that method. Do not emit a clause for an unconfirmed concession.
